 applets/showdesktop/MinimizeAllController.qml |  4 +++
 applets/showdesktop/showdesktop.cpp           | 30 +++++++++++++++++++
 applets/showdesktop/showdesktop.h             | 13 ++++++++
 4 files changed, 49 insertions(+)

